get.description:
The typed retrieval layer: list a document's figures/tables/equations/code, filtered by
``scope`` (a toc: key → section + descendants) and/or ``type``. Figures carry an ``imageRef``;
fetch the bytes from ``/api/figure?doc=&n=<order>``.

post.description:
Start a background concept extraction (queued). ``?scope=toc:1`` = one chapter (and
everything under it); body ``sectionKeys`` = an exact set (the TOC-preview selection);
neither = the whole document (slow). Returns immediately with ``status:running``.
